    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/e485705dd169bb7d941ba501c377e246.webp?t=1722812857\" width=616 height=60 /></span><br><br>The platformer where you're broke! <i>Slime Voyage</i> is a 2D-Platformer where you travel the world working odd jobs to get paid. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/4ae8241e2b584d3edc8d779408f56386.poster.avif?t=1722812857\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/4ae8241e2b584d3edc8d779408f56386.webm?t=1722812857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/4ae8241e2b584d3edc8d779408f56386.mp4?t=1722812857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>So what's the plan...?</i> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/f282fdec6d597a1a2f7c22368c0e418e.avif?t=1722812857\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><br>You're a slime. Your goal? Some really, like <i><strong>REALLY</strong></i> cool sunglasses\u2122. <br>Work odd jobs to fund your dream and try not to destroy everything along the way. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/aa9a873f2b0209c684bcc97a74558b0e.poster.avif?t=1722812857\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/aa9a873f2b0209c684bcc97a74558b0e.webm?t=1722812857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/aa9a873f2b0209c684bcc97a74558b0e.mp4?t=1722812857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/f323306ed20cf0312f087bc42810aec8.avif?t=1722812857\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><br>To fund his dreams, Slime takes up all kinds of job offers. <br>From <i>investigating the disappearance of a cult leader in a bottomless pit</i>, to a relaxing afternoon trimming the hedges of an overgrown flower garden...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/399edc9fc2294f34e48b4d7bf89bd63b.poster.avif?t=1722812857\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/399edc9fc2294f34e48b4d7bf89bd63b.webm?t=1722812857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/399edc9fc2294f34e48b4d7bf89bd63b.mp4?t=1722812857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/e467794666908f425959848bf4898dd9.avif?t=1722812857\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><br>Reap the sweet rewards!<br><br>Use your hard-earned money to splurge on house accessories, access secret worlds, and snatch those - really, like <strong><i>REALLY</i></strong> cool sunglasses\u2122.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/c22e68b79a77b6386b3c231beabd359a.poster.avif?t=1722812857\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/c22e68b79a77b6386b3c231beabd359a.webm?t=1722812857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/c22e68b79a77b6386b3c231beabd359a.mp4?t=1722812857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/bfc8a56e19d17639a0a7f371d683ddc4.webp?t=1722812857\" width=616 height=60 /></span><br><br> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Satisfying, precise platforming.<br> </li><li>Silly lil' guys...<br> </li><li>Breaking it down.<br> </li><li>Original soundtrack with the most <i>fonkiest music.</i><br> </li><li>Beautiful, yet smooth pixel art.<br> </li><li>Starring in a <i>dating sim?!</i><br> </li><li>Minimum wage!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/82fb95b4ab0abbd9bf664fc35d1e41d8.poster.avif?t=1722812857\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/82fb95b4ab0abbd9bf664fc35d1e41d8.webm?t=1722812857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/82fb95b4ab0abbd9bf664fc35d1e41d8.mp4?t=1722812857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/aeadb8a0e1ca031ef8865d171bde1ace.poster.avif?t=1722812857\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/aeadb8a0e1ca031ef8865d171bde1ace.webm?t=1722812857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015960/extras/aeadb8a0e1ca031ef8865d171bde1ace.mp4?t=172281